      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T04:00:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It gets split there. certificate-manager prints the DN with\nXN_FLAG_SEP_COMMA_PLUS, which doesn\u0027t escape \u0027,\u0027 inside a value, so a value of \"x,CN\u003dy\" looks the same as two attributes. Handling it needs certificate-manager to print an escaped form such as XN_FLAG_RFC2253 (which also reverses the RDN order) and bmcweb to unescape it, so I\u0027d leave that for a separate change.",
